### Active Spot markets scanned by the Demo scheduler
GET http://localhost:3000/assets/active

### Current active strategy signal for a market
GET http://localhost:3000/signals/BTCUSDT/1h

### Open virtual Spot Demo positions
GET http://localhost:3000/demo-trading/open

### Closed Demo positions (WIN / LOSS history)
GET http://localhost:3000/demo-trading/history

### Official Demo performance summary
GET http://localhost:3000/demo-trading/summary

### Run a closed-candle check manually if required
POST http://localhost:3000/demo-trading/check

### Backtest the active hourly strategy for one market
GET http://localhost:3000/backtesting/BTCUSDT/1h
